Description: CIT-OS base identity, branding and configuration
 Shared branding and configuration for every CIT-OS target (Raspberry Pi,
 desktop, server/pods, containers). Provides the CIT-OS identity (os-release),
 the MOTD/issue banners and the brand assets, so branding is defined once and
 flows to all targets.
